S | Full Time | $70,000 - $80,000 per year Posted: Aug 31, 2026 View Job Associate Director of Residence Life 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Full Time | $61,000 - $64,000 per year Posted: Aug 27, 2026 View Job Clinical Adjunct Position: Clinical Instructor 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Part Time | $3000 - $9000 other Posted: Mar 26, 2021 View Job Club Sports Coach- Men's Basketball 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Part Time | $1500 - $1500 per year Posted: Jul 23, 2026 View Job Director of the Office of Violence Prevention & Education 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Full Time | $58,000 - $65,000 per year Posted: Sep 15, 2026 View Job Faculty Fellow, Department of Education in Ontario 2904 Hwy 7, Vaughan, ON, Canada | Full Time | $62,000 - $71,200 per year Posted: Aug 20, 2026 View Job Part-Time Adjunct Instructor - Department of Mathematics 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Part Time | $2500 other Posted: May 13, 2021 View Job Student Accounts Operations Manager 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Full Time | $23.63 - $27.19 per hour Posted: Oct 14, 2026 View Job Temporary Employment - Assistant Dance Line Coach 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Contract | $300 - $500 other Posted: Jul 10, 2026 View Job Title IX Coordinator and Civil Rights Officer 5795 Lewiston Rd, Niagara University, NY 14109, US | Full Time | $80,000 - $85,000 per year Posted: Sep 03, 2026 View Job Sign Up For Job Alerts! Name You must type a name. Email You must type a valid email. Location (city, state or zip code) You must select a location. Accept Terms of Service I agree to the terms of service and privacy policy. You must accept the terms of service and privacy policy. Send Me Jobs Would you like Refer.io to send you similar jobs from other employers? Yes, daily! Yes, weekly! No, thanks. Please type the job title you are interested in: Job title You mu